      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5732c389e61075cc",
      "translationZh": "无论我怎么设置 --tensor-split (-ts) 参数，总有至少 1+GB 的显存用不上。稍微往一边调一点，权重就会大幅移到另一边。😵‍💫 调整上下文会让两边的显存占用同时增加或减少。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0af0b0af2ff974d8",
      "translationZh": "试过分别将 --spec-draft-device 设为 CUDA0 和 CUDA1，完全没有变化。（分布与上面相同）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21251d99bd2a7522",
      "translationZh": "也试过 --mmproj-device，没多大区别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4c803bbb6791592",
      "translationZh": "试过 --no-mmproj-offload，不知怎么的，占用较低的那一边反而更低了 🫣",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
